WEBVTT

00:44.837 --> 00:46.589
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 4

00:51.969 --> 00:55.848
There's no way he'll check online.

00:55.931 --> 00:56.807
Not him.

00:58.100 --> 00:59.977
Like he'd ever look up We Were Friends.

01:00.644 --> 01:01.562
Not him.

01:03.105 --> 01:04.523
There's absolutely no way.

01:09.695 --> 01:10.529
PAZER WEB NOVEL PORTAL

01:10.613 --> 01:12.031
WE WERE FRIENDS

01:12.114 --> 01:15.826
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 4

01:17.620 --> 01:19.038
…YOON ONLY HAD EYES FOR TAE-HA…

01:29.340 --> 01:31.509
Unbelievable. You little…

01:39.058 --> 01:40.309
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 1

01:44.230 --> 01:45.231
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 2

01:47.191 --> 01:48.275
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 3

01:50.361 --> 01:52.780
END OF EPISODE 3

02:01.288 --> 02:04.834
CHAPTER 23: YOUR ROUGH THOUGHTS
AND ANXIOUS LOOKS

02:09.964 --> 02:12.341
EPISODE 7

02:14.176 --> 02:15.177
You know what?

02:15.261 --> 02:16.762
By the looks of things,

02:16.846 --> 02:18.472
EBC is also excited

02:18.973 --> 02:21.016
about the math class.

02:22.893 --> 02:24.186
I don't blame them.

02:24.270 --> 02:26.689
After all, it is taught by a math genius.

02:27.356 --> 02:29.233
-Right?
-Sure.

02:30.234 --> 02:32.653
Of course,
I totally respect your decision.

02:32.736 --> 02:33.946
There's no pressure.

02:34.029 --> 02:35.322
-No pressure at all.
-No.

02:35.406 --> 02:39.785
But sometimes,
people do change their minds.

02:39.869 --> 02:41.495
So, I thought I'd ask one last time.

02:41.579 --> 02:42.955
In case you've changed…

02:43.038 --> 02:44.039
I guess you haven't.

02:48.294 --> 02:49.837
Do something, will you?

02:59.805 --> 03:00.764
Today's the day.

03:01.599 --> 03:04.810
Until we're are done with filming,

03:04.894 --> 03:08.939
until EBC crew wraps up and leaves school,

03:09.023 --> 03:11.483
I want everyone to stay sharp

03:11.567 --> 03:14.862
and refrain from saying anything
that could harm the school's reputation.

03:15.696 --> 03:16.947
Homeroom teachers,

03:17.031 --> 03:19.074
check your students' uniforms

03:19.158 --> 03:21.702
and make sure
they're on their best behavior.

03:21.785 --> 03:24.413
Hopefully, everything will go off
without a hitch.

03:24.997 --> 03:27.249
Let's make sure this is a success.

03:27.333 --> 03:29.460
We got this!

03:29.543 --> 03:30.711
-Okay.
-Of course.

03:31.795 --> 03:33.297
Especially, our new teachers.

03:33.380 --> 03:35.257
And the star of the show,

03:35.883 --> 03:37.259
Mr. Ga Woo-su.

03:38.052 --> 03:42.389
Mr. Ga Woo-su.

03:42.473 --> 03:44.266
-Yes.
-Thank you in advance.

03:45.351 --> 03:48.145
Let's get this done!

03:49.480 --> 03:51.565
Da-ju, everything's sorted, right?

03:51.649 --> 03:54.985
Yes, by hook or by crook,
we'll get what we need.

03:57.404 --> 03:58.280
Aunt Young-hee.

04:00.616 --> 04:02.660
Here's the man of the hour.

04:02.743 --> 04:05.663
How is it that you look so good

04:05.746 --> 04:08.791
in such flamboyant clothes?

04:08.874 --> 04:11.251
Then, I'll put my faith in you.

04:11.335 --> 04:12.795
-Yes, ma'am.
-Good.

04:14.713 --> 04:17.508
So, you're the principal's nephew.

04:24.640 --> 04:28.018
Aunt Young-hee, clearly,
the highlight of today's filming

04:28.102 --> 04:29.645
will be my flute solo.

04:29.728 --> 04:32.648
When the curtains open
to reveal me on stage,

04:32.731 --> 04:34.400
the spotlight will shine on me.

04:34.483 --> 04:36.944
Basically, it'll be game over then.

04:37.027 --> 04:38.946
Drink this.

04:42.616 --> 04:43.701
What?

04:48.330 --> 04:50.124
This is from my favorite place.

04:50.207 --> 04:51.959
I know.

04:52.042 --> 04:54.128
Drink up.

04:54.211 --> 04:55.963
Keep drinking.

04:57.381 --> 05:00.134
Go on, get every last drop.

05:25.451 --> 05:26.618
You play so well.

05:26.702 --> 05:29.830
I might have to quit teaching
when the episode airs.

05:32.291 --> 05:36.712
Did you see the new guys
have all turned up in suits?

05:36.795 --> 05:37.921
Honestly.

05:38.005 --> 05:41.884
At best, they'll be caught
in the background for a split second.

05:41.967 --> 05:44.344
I actually feel sorry for them.

05:44.428 --> 05:46.221
Tell me about it.

05:47.473 --> 05:49.683
It's not kicking in right away.

05:49.767 --> 05:50.893
Huh? What was that?

05:59.193 --> 06:02.237
There's no time for this.
I should go rehearse with the camera crew.

06:11.455 --> 06:15.501
I'm sorry about this, E-den.

06:16.543 --> 06:17.753
Film him on the sly?

06:17.836 --> 06:18.962
Come on.

06:19.046 --> 06:21.715
Don't put it like that.
You make it sound illegal.

06:22.299 --> 06:26.136
If you just happen to turn this on,

06:27.846 --> 06:30.516
it will just happen to record
whatever's in front of it.

06:31.600 --> 06:32.601
I can't.

06:32.684 --> 06:33.852
I really can't.

06:35.270 --> 06:37.022
I need to keep my head down.

06:37.106 --> 06:39.358
If I mess up again, I'll end up in jail.

06:40.818 --> 06:42.027
Wait, sit back down.

06:43.445 --> 06:45.489
I know Woo-su is a bit of a tyrant,

06:45.572 --> 06:47.157
but he wouldn't send a student to jail.

06:47.699 --> 06:48.659
You have to do this

06:48.742 --> 06:51.286
to make up for all the time
you goofed off in my class.

06:51.912 --> 06:53.747
The gall of writing an essay in my class.

06:53.831 --> 06:55.499
Do you know how hurt I was?

06:56.166 --> 06:59.753
I'm really sorry about that, but…

07:01.213 --> 07:03.757
There's a good reason
why I'm entrusting this to you.

07:03.841 --> 07:05.134
Don't you see that?

07:05.217 --> 07:06.468
No.

07:08.303 --> 07:09.388
If you don't do this,

07:11.515 --> 07:12.975
we'll all be fired.

07:13.058 --> 07:14.184
Are you okay with that?

07:14.268 --> 07:15.435
Fired?

07:16.603 --> 07:19.064
Principal's orders.

07:19.857 --> 07:21.400
You know how she'll react

07:21.483 --> 07:23.110
if we disobey her.

07:23.193 --> 07:24.027
If we get fired,

07:24.945 --> 07:25.863
I'll be fine.

07:28.615 --> 07:29.491
But…

07:30.492 --> 07:34.454
I'm not sure Mr. Jung and Mr. Yoon
will land on their feet so easily.

07:36.498 --> 07:38.542
Why not?

07:39.459 --> 07:43.005
Mr. Jung will struggle to get another job
because of his leg.

07:44.506 --> 07:47.217
And as for Mr. Yoon, well…

07:58.061 --> 07:59.354
That can't happen.

07:59.438 --> 08:00.397
Exactly.

08:00.981 --> 08:01.815
That can't happen.

08:02.691 --> 08:03.525
And besides,

08:05.569 --> 08:06.820
I know everything.

08:07.779 --> 08:08.614
About what?

08:09.114 --> 08:10.115
Seriously?

08:10.824 --> 08:12.618
I'm more observant than you think.

08:13.327 --> 08:14.953
I could tell right away.

08:15.037 --> 08:16.705
Did you really think I wouldn't notice?

08:19.041 --> 08:21.293
I'm not sure what you're talking about.

08:23.712 --> 08:25.339
I knew all along.

08:26.465 --> 08:27.591
Right from the beginning.

08:29.551 --> 08:31.428
Your rough thoughts

08:32.179 --> 08:33.347
and anxious looks.

08:34.097 --> 08:35.599
How could I not know?

08:37.935 --> 08:39.144
I'll keep it a secret

08:39.895 --> 08:40.938
as long as you film.

08:41.021 --> 08:42.022
Okay?

08:48.570 --> 08:50.572
How does he know about my novel?

08:53.242 --> 08:55.327
Come on, kids.
This isn't the time for idle chats.

08:55.410 --> 08:57.079
Don't you know
the camera crew is here today?

08:57.162 --> 08:58.080
You girls should…

09:00.791 --> 09:03.293
Don't forget
you're the face of our school!

09:03.919 --> 09:07.839
Kids, why aren't any of you studying?

09:09.424 --> 09:11.760
Chat away in English.

09:11.843 --> 09:14.012
Solve some math problems too.
They're a delight, no?

09:14.930 --> 09:15.764
Hey.

09:16.974 --> 09:17.808
Hello?

09:19.476 --> 09:20.602
Hey, kid.

09:20.686 --> 09:21.853
Ji-a.

09:22.437 --> 09:23.563
Ji-a.

09:27.567 --> 09:28.610
Where's your uniform?

09:30.279 --> 09:31.321
I washed it.

09:31.405 --> 09:32.322
Why?

09:33.031 --> 09:36.535
Why wash it
when you have to wear it to school?

09:37.577 --> 09:38.787
I got oil on it.

09:40.998 --> 09:43.709
You should have still worn it
even if it had oil stains.

09:43.792 --> 09:47.587
You should have worn it even if it was
still soaking wet from the laundry.

09:47.671 --> 09:49.673
Why today of all days?

09:49.756 --> 09:50.757
Where's your gym clothes?

09:50.841 --> 09:51.842
I don't have them with me.

09:51.925 --> 09:54.136
Then borrow one and get changed.

09:54.761 --> 09:55.929
Never mind.

09:56.013 --> 09:57.931
That's not necessary. What's your name?

09:58.015 --> 09:59.099
Choi Ji-a, ma'am.

09:59.182 --> 10:00.600
Bring your desk and come with me.

10:01.476 --> 10:02.894
Come on, don't dawdle.

10:02.978 --> 10:04.521
There's no time.

10:07.316 --> 10:08.150
What's going on?

10:09.818 --> 10:11.403
Mr. Ga.

10:12.321 --> 10:14.489
I'm going to take Choi Ji-a

10:14.573 --> 10:17.326
and have her study in the counseling room
until the fifth period.

10:17.909 --> 10:20.078
-Bring your desk this way.
-Go back to the classroom.

10:22.164 --> 10:23.415
Mr. Ga.

10:23.915 --> 10:25.959
Can I have a word?

10:29.796 --> 10:32.674
As you know,
we have the EBC crew here filming today.

10:32.758 --> 10:34.926
She sleeps through class anyway,

10:35.010 --> 10:37.095
and she isn't even wearing her uniform.

10:37.179 --> 10:40.474
What's more,
look at the state of her clothes.

10:41.683 --> 10:43.310
Today is such an important day.

10:43.393 --> 10:44.978
Given she might ruin
the school's reputation,

10:45.062 --> 10:46.521
it's better she's not here at all.

10:46.605 --> 10:49.858
I'm terrified she'll end up on camera.

10:50.901 --> 10:53.570
I still don't think it calls for
hiding one of our students.

10:54.821 --> 10:57.949
Don't be so naive, Mr. Ga.

10:58.033 --> 11:00.327
TV shows are all scripted anyway.

11:00.410 --> 11:02.037
Just until fifth period, okay?

11:02.120 --> 11:03.246
Hey.

11:03.330 --> 11:05.415
If you won't allow Ji-a
to be here for the shoot,

11:06.041 --> 11:09.294
then none of my class
will take part in it.

11:14.591 --> 11:15.884
Says who?

11:16.802 --> 11:17.886
Mr. Ga.

11:17.969 --> 11:20.680
I believe I made myself clear.

11:22.182 --> 11:23.016
Let's go.

11:23.809 --> 11:24.810
Pick it up.

11:39.741 --> 11:40.617
Darn it.

11:43.620 --> 11:45.247
I'll deal with you later, Mr. Ga.

11:45.330 --> 11:46.498
Are they here?

11:47.249 --> 11:48.291
I'm coming.

11:50.544 --> 11:52.295
Go back inside.
Everyone back to your seats.

12:00.470 --> 12:04.933
CHAPTER 24:
OUR SCHOOL RIGHT NOW

12:27.873 --> 12:30.750
Why did you choose Murim Girls' High?

12:39.009 --> 12:39.843
Our school…

12:39.926 --> 12:42.762
I'm Kim Dan-ji,
the Murim Girls' High connection.

12:42.846 --> 12:46.016
The sports field is really nice.
What else?

12:46.099 --> 12:49.478
And we've got a really hot teacher.

12:49.561 --> 12:51.104
-That's Mr. Yoon Dong-ju.
-For real. No!

12:51.188 --> 12:52.606
-No, Mr. Jung Gi-jeon--
-Mr. Yoon.

12:52.689 --> 12:55.442
-Come on, Mr. Noh's the hot one.
-No, that's Mr. Jung.

12:57.027 --> 12:59.988
I don't think I can do it. Really.

13:00.614 --> 13:01.573
Yes, you can!

13:02.157 --> 13:04.326
There's nothing you can't do.

13:04.409 --> 13:06.036
Don't be so negative.

13:06.119 --> 13:08.747
Remember, all Murim students
are full of potential.

13:08.830 --> 13:10.040
-Go for it.
-How is that relevant?

13:10.123 --> 13:11.458
He's here.

13:11.541 --> 13:12.584
I'm off. Don't mess up.

13:12.667 --> 13:13.502
Got it?

13:24.596 --> 13:26.932
Don't overthink this problem.

13:27.015 --> 13:29.935
There are two solutions
with the given conditions.

13:30.018 --> 13:31.937
First, the value of x…

13:32.020 --> 13:34.523
If he catches me filming him,
he'll go ballistic.

13:35.273 --> 13:36.566
And the tangent line…

13:36.650 --> 13:40.529
On the other hand,
he has told them about my novel

13:40.612 --> 13:42.364
after telling me he'd keep it a secret.

13:42.447 --> 13:43.532
Let's just do it.

13:43.615 --> 13:44.741
Mr. Ga.

13:47.244 --> 13:48.078
I…

13:48.787 --> 13:50.455
have a question.

13:53.250 --> 13:54.084
What is it?

13:58.880 --> 14:01.091
Well, I heard

14:01.716 --> 14:04.469
a famous university in another country

14:04.553 --> 14:07.055
offered you a job as a professor.

14:07.138 --> 14:09.099
Why did you come here instead?

14:12.269 --> 14:13.520
Why are you asking that now?

14:15.981 --> 14:18.149
I've been curious all along.

14:18.775 --> 14:22.612
It's amazing to have a genius like you
teaching at our school.

14:23.238 --> 14:26.533
I thought there might be a special reason.

14:30.662 --> 14:33.290
Isn't a question like that
better saved for after class?

14:34.165 --> 14:37.794
Mr. Ga, we're all curious.

14:37.877 --> 14:40.922
-Tell us.
-If you tell us, we'll study harder.

14:41.006 --> 14:42.465
-Tell us!
-Tell us!

14:42.549 --> 14:43.717
-Tell us!
-Tell us!

14:43.800 --> 14:46.970
-Tell us!
-Tell us!

14:47.053 --> 14:48.138
-Tell us!
-Quiet, everyone.

14:50.056 --> 14:51.182
Fine.

14:51.266 --> 14:54.603
I guess it might be helpful
in thinking about your own futures.

14:58.815 --> 15:01.735
The six kids invited
to the Mathematical Olympiad

15:01.818 --> 15:03.820
attend two separate training camps.

15:03.903 --> 15:05.572
On the day of the first camp,

15:05.655 --> 15:09.326
as soon as we finished registering,
our first exam was waiting for us.

15:09.909 --> 15:10.785
That exam…

15:48.156 --> 15:48.990
Take it out.

15:51.451 --> 15:52.369
I said take it out.

16:11.888 --> 16:15.433
Mr. Ga! Just a moment. Let me explain.

16:15.517 --> 16:18.144
Mr. Noh told me if I didn't do it,

16:18.228 --> 16:19.771
you'd all get fired.

16:19.854 --> 16:22.190
That's the only reason I did it, sir.

16:22.273 --> 16:23.525
Please hear me out, sir.

16:23.608 --> 16:26.027
We can't have you all lose your jobs,
can we, sir?

16:27.278 --> 16:28.113
Noh Da-ju.

16:28.196 --> 16:30.073
You asked a student
to film me behind my back?

16:30.156 --> 16:31.074
Have you lost it?

16:35.203 --> 16:37.580
Mr. Ga, why don't you calm down

16:38.164 --> 16:39.207
so we can talk about it?

16:39.791 --> 16:41.960
What do you mean
by filming behind your back?

16:42.043 --> 16:43.044
Who would…

16:43.670 --> 16:45.588
do something so unethical?

16:46.673 --> 16:48.425
How could you film me like this?

16:48.508 --> 16:49.884
You of all people should know better.

16:49.968 --> 16:50.885
Guys.

16:50.969 --> 16:52.220
What's going on?

16:52.303 --> 16:53.388
Hey.

16:53.471 --> 16:55.140
That was so long ago.

16:55.223 --> 16:56.808
You have to move on.

16:56.891 --> 16:58.017
You can't go on like this.

17:01.521 --> 17:03.773
Hey!

17:05.567 --> 17:06.860
Mr. Ga.

17:10.864 --> 17:12.282
May I have a word?

17:28.757 --> 17:29.591
Sir.

17:29.674 --> 17:32.677
-Jeez, you idiot.
-What's the matter?

17:32.761 --> 17:35.346
Did something happen
to Mr. Ga in the past?

17:41.436 --> 17:43.021
I don't know the details.

17:44.147 --> 17:45.565
But when Woo-su was about ten,

17:46.733 --> 17:49.694
someone started stalking him
after he was on TV as a math prodigy.

17:50.570 --> 17:51.988
I heard that crazy stalker

17:52.655 --> 17:54.783
would turn up at his school and his house

17:55.575 --> 17:58.119
to film and take photos of him
behind his back.

17:58.787 --> 17:59.829
Eventually,

18:01.414 --> 18:02.582
he even kidnapped him.

18:04.250 --> 18:05.293
Kidnapped?

18:15.220 --> 18:16.513
That left Woo-su traumatized.

18:27.816 --> 18:29.317
My goodness.

18:30.735 --> 18:32.028
What's wrong?

18:33.488 --> 18:34.906
Mr. Ga.

18:34.989 --> 18:37.116
This is the real world.

18:37.200 --> 18:38.743
You might be smart,

18:38.827 --> 18:40.995
but being obedient

18:41.079 --> 18:43.623
will help you get further in life.

18:43.706 --> 18:45.917
It won't kill you to get filmed,

18:46.000 --> 18:48.294
so what's the big deal?

18:52.382 --> 18:53.341
Please excuse me.

18:54.551 --> 18:56.678
If you're not going to cooperate,

18:56.761 --> 18:58.763
you leave me no choice.

19:06.771 --> 19:08.398
SUSPENSION NOTICE

19:09.065 --> 19:10.608
YOON DONG-JU

19:10.692 --> 19:13.653
The rest of you might land on your feet,

19:14.529 --> 19:18.324
but if Mr. Yoon loses his job here,
he'll struggle.

19:26.541 --> 19:27.375
From this equation,

19:27.458 --> 19:30.420
it's clear that negative four is
the average rate of change.

19:30.503 --> 19:32.672
Next, we have to calculate f prime of x.

19:34.257 --> 19:35.633
Two x minus three.

19:35.717 --> 19:37.635
What was the average rate of change again?

19:37.719 --> 19:39.345
-Negative four.
-Negative four.

19:40.722 --> 19:42.140
It was negative four.

19:46.769 --> 19:49.981
He could have just filmed from the start.
Why all the drama?

19:51.107 --> 19:52.317
Tell me about it.

19:52.400 --> 19:54.611
We're going to end up finishing late
because of him.

19:54.694 --> 19:56.112
-I'm so annoyed.
-So the value of x

19:56.195 --> 19:57.322
is negative one-half,

19:57.405 --> 20:00.950
which happens to be a number
between negative three and two.

20:04.495 --> 20:06.205
Accordingly, c is…

20:11.210 --> 20:12.921
It's finally over.

20:13.004 --> 20:15.173
CHAPTER 25: I ONLY FEEL BETRAYED
BECAUSE I TRUSTED YOU

20:29.103 --> 20:29.938
Aunt Young-hee.

20:30.521 --> 20:32.440
Wait, what am I doing here?

20:33.024 --> 20:36.152
You said you were going to take a nap
because you didn't sleep well last night,

20:36.235 --> 20:38.196
and you've been asleep all this time.

20:39.614 --> 20:40.448
Did I?

20:41.407 --> 20:42.408
That doesn't make sense.

20:43.117 --> 20:44.160
What about the filming?

20:44.243 --> 20:46.579
It's all over.

20:46.663 --> 20:47.580
What?

20:48.206 --> 20:49.624
No way.

20:50.708 --> 20:51.793
No.

20:53.461 --> 20:54.295
No.

20:54.379 --> 20:56.130
No. Don't go. Stop.

20:56.214 --> 20:58.549
I can't believe this!

20:58.633 --> 21:00.218
Don't go!

21:00.301 --> 21:03.137
No!

21:34.377 --> 21:36.462
You're not a snake charmer!

21:53.938 --> 21:55.148
Sir…

21:59.694 --> 22:00.778
Mr. Ga.

22:27.388 --> 22:28.890
I…

22:29.599 --> 22:30.600
Mr. Ga.

22:33.311 --> 22:35.021
I'm so sorry.

22:36.189 --> 22:39.817
I would never have filmed you
if I had known what had happened to you.

22:41.152 --> 22:42.111
No.

22:42.195 --> 22:44.113
I shouldn't have filmed you regardless.

22:44.197 --> 22:46.449
I'm really sorry. I made a mistake.

22:54.248 --> 22:56.084
You asked me a question in math class.

22:57.335 --> 22:59.796
Do you know what flashed through my head
at that exact moment?

23:03.633 --> 23:05.301
"Is she actually
starting to like math now?"

23:11.599 --> 23:13.559
When I heard your question,
I went, "All right."

23:14.811 --> 23:16.312
"It's a tangent, but it's a start."

23:17.688 --> 23:19.232
I figured my story

23:19.315 --> 23:21.818
might get you interested in math,

23:22.693 --> 23:24.612
so I was going to
give you a sincere answer.

23:27.281 --> 23:28.199
But you…

23:34.956 --> 23:36.124
I guess I only feel betrayed

23:36.707 --> 23:38.501
because I trusted you.

23:40.545 --> 23:41.879
Forget it. Just go.

23:47.385 --> 23:49.178
I apologize for

23:49.804 --> 23:50.972
disappointing you.

23:52.265 --> 23:53.099
Just go.

24:11.033 --> 24:11.909
Get up.

24:13.077 --> 24:14.704
I said get up. Enough with the acting.

24:22.086 --> 24:23.171
Eui-ju.

24:25.089 --> 24:26.048
Eui-ju.

24:28.050 --> 24:30.052
Hey, Eui-ju.

24:30.136 --> 24:31.512
Wake up, Eui-ju!

24:32.763 --> 24:34.098
Eui-ju.

24:34.182 --> 24:35.349
Stay with me, Eui-ju!

25:51.550 --> 25:53.552
Subtitle: Paul Carver
